**Module 1: `Poincare.D13.ManifoldIBP.SmoothPartition`** (new)
Contents: a finite smooth partition of unity on `Vec d` subordinate to a finite open cover of a compact set.

```lean
theorem exists_smooth_partitionOfUnity_subordinate {d : ℕ} {N : ℕ}
    (U : Fin N → Set (Vec d)) (hUo : ∀ k, IsOpen (U k))
    {K : Set (Vec d)} (hK : IsCompact K) (hKU : K ⊆ ⋃ k, U k) :
    ∃ ψ : Fin N → Vec d → ℝ,
      (∀ k, ContDiff ℝ ⊤ (ψ k)) ∧
      (∀ k x, 0 ≤ ψ k x) ∧
      (∀ k, tsupport (ψ k) ⊆ U k) ∧
      (∀ x ∈ K, ∑ k, ψ k x = 1)
```

